**
# vsce applies `!` patterns after all ignore patterns: a broad `!dist/**` would also re-include
# source maps and any stale build artifact. List the three files esbuild actually produces.
!dist/extension.js
!dist/webview.js
!dist/webview.css
!media/**
!package.json
!package.nls*.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
